{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act48side_level_act48side_04_beg","storyGroup":"act48side","storySort":8,"storyDependence":"act48side_level_act48side_03_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"ME-4","storyName":"失手","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"第一神殿重建现场之外，运河上的摆渡人赞索斯盯上了缇缇，以及她带来雅赛努斯的文物。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act48side/level_act48side_04_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act48side_04","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":6,"next":8,"characters":["帕拉斯","缇缇","旅店老板","吕刻伊昂","哀叹的男声","淡定的男声","赫卡德墨","慌张的客人","治安官","？？？","好事的人","无聊的人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","duration":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_bg_69_g14_luxuriousroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":8},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#18$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#18$1","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"“于是阿加门最温柔的英雄，史诗的吟唱者克瑞斯拉，将她的竖琴挂在月桂的树梢上；”","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"“那把琴——它的琴身来自荷谟伊高山中耸立的杉树，它的琴弦取自阿涅斯平原上勇猛驮兽的肚肠；”","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"“当它鸣响，万物便在英雄的国度歌唱，自由地，飘向远方。”","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"缇缇，难怪当时你看到克瑞斯拉雕像落成，就想到了要把文物交换仪式的地点放在神殿广场上。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"原来你带来交换的，就是克瑞斯拉当初使用过的竖琴，还是曾摆放在旧雅赛努斯城第一神殿中的那一把？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"是的！","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"传说克瑞斯拉在荷谟伊山下听到群山讲述的故事，深受鼓舞。而后她便用山岩与杉树作为材料，制作了一把巨大的竖琴。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"那是一把获得了祝福的琴，传闻只有在重要的日子，或是由如克瑞斯拉般的英雄拨动琴弦，它才会将清越的琴声送进人们的心里。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"不过，萨尔贡人攻入旧雅赛努斯城后，城中一片混乱，第一神殿也随之被毁。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"竖琴似乎也为这悲痛的一幕而哑然，自此之后不再发声，后来更是不知所终。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"但幸运的是，赫里帕夏在他的收藏中找到了它。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"虽然不知道琴是怎么去的萨尔贡——我想可能是当时某个萨尔贡士兵将它从旧雅赛努斯盗走，转手卖给了帕夏的祖上。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"l","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"唔，按年份推算，现在雅赛努斯城内，已无人亲眼见过当年还在原址的那把竖琴。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"或许只有少数熟谙典籍的祭司，或是卡珊卓拉那种能与众英雄对话的天赋者，才对这把琴有所了解。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"这竖琴仍能发声？","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"可以。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"对藏品进行检测时，我们确认过琴弦，虽有一定程度的老化，但仍能奏响。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"原来如此，看来传说中琴因战乱而沉默，或许只是一个米诺斯故事里惯用的比喻......","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":39},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":40},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_bg_69_g5_athenusalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":43},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"怎么渡口的人还没来？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"我们旅店付了这么高的租金开在河道边上，不就是为了以最快的速度拿到最新鲜的鳞获嘛。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"charslot","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"老板，食材到了。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"哎哟，你们可算来了！今天的食材再不送到，可就来不及招待使节团的贵客了......","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"我帮您卸货？","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"等等，这船今天怎么停得这么远？一会儿卸货，人非得跌到水里不可。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"小哥，麻烦你再把货船往前开开，离后厨越近越好。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"......","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"好。","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"多谢多谢。不过，今天来送货的怎么是你，往常不都是赞索斯负责的吗？","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"老师有点事要处理，抱歉。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"好说好说，反正食材也送到了，别耽误后厨开工就行。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"你跟着赞索斯也有两三年了吧？他做事严谨，这么安排肯定有他的道理，我完全放心。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"......","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":74},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"charslot","id":77},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_bg_69_g14_luxuriousroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"all","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","focus":"all","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#11$2","focus":"r","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"不好意思啊，帕拉斯。今天神殿的所有人都在赶工，我实在没办法从搬运队里抽调帮手。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"作为交换仪式的一环，我想提前把琴放到第一神殿里去，看看是否能匹配上克瑞斯拉雕像。","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"不过这么重的一把竖琴，我本该找个高大的工匠来帮忙搬运，仅凭我们两个......","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"欸，此话差矣。据史料记载，克瑞斯拉本人身材也并不高大，站在竖琴旁会呈现出极大的反差。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"说不定我一个人就足够了——","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-50,-30","duration":"1.5","focus":"l","id":92},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,-30","posto":"-45,-30","duration":"2.5","block":"true","focus":"l","id":94},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2.5","xstrength":"0","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"10","randomness":"10","fadeout":"false","block":"true","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dragheavybox","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","action":"shake","random":"true","power":"50","times":"3","duration":"0.8","focus":"l","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":98},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"呼......这个木箱里面是灌了铅吗，怎么这么沉？","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-50,-30","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"哈哈......我们从古道进入雅赛努斯，路途颠簸，而文物交换事关重大，不能有任何闪失。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"出发之前我特地找了我的博物馆的库管员，准备了既能防水避火，又能抗震减压的包材，货物的重量自然也就翻倍了。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#6$2","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"不过好处是，哪怕是楼房倒塌或者突发地震，也伤不了它一点！","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"看得出来，你对自己的博物馆和藏品都很上心。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$2","focus":"r","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我因为对什么都挺感兴趣的，所以干脆去哥伦比亚读了博物馆学，回萨尔贡之后，顺势就进了博物馆。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"不过，我的父亲早逝，家族没落......说实话，到现在我都不是很清楚，为什么我会被帕夏选为萨尔贡使节团的大使......","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"但事已至此，就得认真对待才行！","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"缇缇，我有没有说过，你——","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":118},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":121},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_dust_01","layer":"1","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#8$1","focus":"all","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$2","focus":"all","id":124},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":125},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":126},{"type":"bgeffect","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"240,0","duration":"0.5","focus":"all","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"40,0","duration":"0.5","focus":"all","id":130},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"0.3","id":131},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","fadeout":"true","xstrength":"16","ystrength":"22","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","block":"false","id":132},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":133},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":134,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#17$1","focus":"l","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"怎么回事？！缇缇，还好吗！","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"240,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2.5","focus":"all","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"40,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2","focus":"all","id":140},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"放心，竖琴没有问题！","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#19$1","focus":"l","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"我问的是你！","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#11$2","focus":"r","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"说地震就来地震......还好文物的防护工作做得到位。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"楼下发生了什么，这么吵？","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"l","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"唔，好像是渡口来的船一头撞进了旅店后厨？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":151},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":152},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":153},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_bg_69_g5_athenusalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":156},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_01","layer":"1","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":158},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":161},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_earthfissure","id":162},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哀叹的男声","text":"完了......全完了！","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哀叹的男声","text":"你到底会不会开船！五米远的距离你鼓什么帆？今天这种大风天，船的速度可比信使荷迈斯的脚程还快！","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"淡定的男声","text":"您说船离后厨越近越好。","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哀叹的男声","text":"......","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哀叹的男声","text":"它们现在都负距离接触了！","id":169},{"type":"dialog","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":171},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#9$1","duration":"1","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"让一让，都让一让。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"治安官已经在疏散人群了，大家不要聚在这里围观。我先来了解一下情况，到底发生什么了——","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"吕刻伊昂？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"......","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"执笔人先生，你可要为我做主啊！","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"我只是想让送食材的货船离后厨更近一些，没想到这个小子直接把我的厨房撞烂了......","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"实在对不起，我......并不会开船。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"你跟着赞索斯那么久了，每天都待在渡口，到现在连开船都不会？骗谁啊！","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"理论知识，不能充分指导实践。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"你——！","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"行了！","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4B/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"我可以作证，还在祭司学院念书的时候，他的方程式战车竞技课考试就没及格过。","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"那、那这么大的停泊标志也没看清？船头可是越过栏杆撞进来的啊！","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"没看清......？","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"（源石感染已经蔓延到了他的视觉中枢......所以那天莱娜小姐才上门诊疗？！）","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"吕刻伊昂......","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"......你这是什么表情，好像我马上就要死——","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"呸呸呸！就算这是事实......不、不准你说这样的话！","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"呃，执笔人先生，我知道你们是同窗，但能不能先秉公帮我处理后厨的损失啊。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"拿着。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2074_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"旅店老板","text":"欸？这是您的钱袋？","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CE/Avg_avg_npc_2074_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"要多少自己拿，我来替他赔。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AA/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"谁要你替我赔钱了？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"你从祭司学院离开之后，也没有一份正经工作。虽然吃住有赞索斯先生管，但也攒不下多少钱吧。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"不用担心这笔赔款，你的钱得拿去治病。别忘了，你还欠我一场辩论。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"不是，我真没事......咳咳......","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A1/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"咳嗽......难不成是急性发作？医生呢，医生在哪儿？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"闭嘴，我这是被烟呛的！理事官的执笔人先生，你还是先去找人救火吧。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"bgeffect","id":231},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_bg_69_g14_luxuriousroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1","focus":"all","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$2","focus":"all","id":234},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":235},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":237},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"火势变大了，看来船头不巧撞在了厨房的火炉上......咳咳，烟雾怎么这么浓？","id":239,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":240},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我们得先离开室内，去空旷的地方，不然吸入太多烟尘就危险了。可这琴......","id":241,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"竖琴的防护措施做得很好，我看楼下已经有治安官在组织灭火了，火势不会蔓延上来，十几分钟内应该就能得到控制。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"l","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"而且，这里上下楼道太窄，搬运竖琴说不定会挡住其他人的撤离路线。再加上，咳咳——","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"帕拉斯你还好吗......","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#11$2","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"你说得对，我们得先离开这里，等烟一散开就回来。走吧。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4C/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":252},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":253},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"charslot","id":257},{"type":"bgeffect","id":258},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_smoke_01","layer":"1","id":259},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4F/Avg_bg_69_g5_athenusalley.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_churchfire","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":261},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":262},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":263},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"1","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"慌张的客人","text":"着火了？完了，我房间里的行李可怎么办啊！","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2088_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"治安官","text":"别担心，着火点在一楼厨房，不会殃及楼上客房，等火完全熄灭、浓烟散去就好。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_2088_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"治安官","text":"大家不要拥挤，不要堵在旅店门口，楼上还有客人没有下来呢——","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_2088_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"治安官","text":"欸，那边那位先生，别急着现在进去啊。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_avg_npc_2088_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......","id":274},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":276},{"type":"charslot","id":277},{"type":"bgeffect","id":278},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$2","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":282},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","style":"slider","inverse":"true","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#12$2","focus":"r","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"怎么样帕拉斯，好一点了吗？","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"l","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"没事，只是被浓烟呛到了。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"再过十来分钟我们应该就能回到房间了，到时候我帮你一起把琴搬到第一神殿去，省得旅店再出事。","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$2","focus":"r","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"谢谢。","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":292},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"50,0","duration":"0.5","id":294},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":295},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":296},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"all","id":297},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":298},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"50,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"啊，这里人太多了，抱歉。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"none","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"......","id":305},{"type":"dialog","id":306},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"none","id":308},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":309},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#5$2","focus":"r","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"帕拉斯，你看到刚刚那个人了吗，好像有些眼熟？","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"嗯？你说谁？","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4A/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1","focus":"none","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的人","text":"喂，你听说了没，船撞上后厨这事是渡口的那个小子干的，没想到人看着挺聪明，开船笨手笨脚的。","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无聊的人","text":"赞索斯呢？货不是一般都是他送？","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"好事的人","text":"不知道啊，可能是太忙来不了吧。不过放任手下不懂事的小子惹出事端，可不是他的做事风格。","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"无聊的人","text":"确实。","id":318},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"2","id":319},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$2","focus":"r","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"......我想起来了，刚刚撞到我的人是渡口的赞索斯先生。","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":322},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"赞索斯？你是不是认错了？","id":323,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"要是有空来旅店，为什么要让自己不熟悉驾驶的徒弟掌舵，还撞坏了后厨？等等......","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#15$2","focus":"r","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我有些不好的预感。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-15$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"我也是。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F9/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":331},{"type":"charslot","id":332},{"type":"image","id":333}],"characters":["帕拉斯","缇缇","旅店老板","吕刻伊昂","哀叹的男声","淡定的男声","赫卡德墨","慌张的客人","治安官","？？？","好事的人","无聊的人"]}